<!--
  Phase 56h.2 (19 May 2026) — small status-bar icon for FCM
  notifications.

  Why this file:
  Android requires the small notification icon to be a single-color
  silhouette on a transparent background. The system tints it white
  (or the device theme's accent) for the status bar. Using the
  multi-color launcher icon causes some OEM ROMs (Samsung One UI,
  Xiaomi MIUI) to silently drop the notification — the smoking gun
  in our "team only sees push when app open" report.

  The shape below is a filled bell. 24dp viewport (Android standard),
  fully opaque white so the system can apply its own tint cleanly.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="24dp"
    android:height="24dp"
    android:viewportWidth="24"
    android:viewportHeight="24"
    android:tint="@android:color/white">
